- collision: exit 1, prints `exists: _archive/...`, moves neither file, archive still reads OLD;
- no match: exit 1 (cannot stat);
- unsubstituted <id>: exit 2 syntax error, nothing moved;
- wrong cwd: exit 1, nothing moved.

